
User Stats Descriptions

   Health  - Health is the amount of hit points your character has.  
             When it reaches 0, you are dead, and will have to use the
             main menu commands [R]esurrect and then the [Z]Heal command.
             It costs $1 per level for each Health point to heal.  
             Resurrections also cost $200!  You gain Health points on 
             certain level advancements. (see ADVANCEMENT).

             
  Strength - Strength ranges from 1-100.  The higher the strength, the
             more damage you will do in combat, and the better encumbrance
             (for carrying weapons/armor/money, etc) you will have.  You
             gain Strenght points on certain level advancements.

        IQ - IQ ranges from 1-100.  The better IQ you have, the greater 
             chance of getting a hint out of someone without torchering them.
             You get bonuses at certain levels.

 Dexterity - Dexterity ranges from 1-100.  Dexterity effects your Armor Class
             (which is how tough you are to hit in combat) and your martial
             arts abilities.  It also effects your "TO HIT" (when trying to 
             battle others a high dexterity always good!)  You get dexterity
             bonuses at certain levels.

  Charisma - Ranges from 1-100.  Effects hints without torcher.  Bonuses
             at certain levels.

 Toughness - Ranges from 1-100. If a human player attacks you and 
             tries to interrogate you with torcher, the higher your Toughness
             the less likely you will tell the other player information 
             regaurding such things such as company records.  Bonuses at
             certain levels.

 Street Smarts - Ranges from 1-100.  The more street smarts you have, the
             more torcher techniques you can use on a person to get important
             information, such as HINTS or company information.  Bonuses at
             certain levels.
             
